<title>USA: FREE-TO-TRADE - Georgia Housing at 0915 EDT.</title>
<headline>FREE-TO-TRADE - Georgia Housing at 0915 EDT.</headline>
<text>
<p>GEORGIA HOUSING AND FINANCE AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $40,000,000</p>
<p>SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE BONDS</p>
<p>1996 SERIES B</p>
<p>Effective at 9:15 A.M. E.D.T., Monday, October 7, 1996</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
